      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Su casa fue Karnak, el templo más grande que construyó Egipto.",
          "en": "His home was Karnak, the biggest temple Egypt ever built."
        },
        {
          "es": "Durante unos 2000 años, muchos reyes le fueron sumando salas, torres y obeliscos.",
          "en": "For about 2,000 years, many kings kept adding halls, gateways, and obelisks."
        },
        {
          "es": "Tiene una sala de 134 columnas gigantes, tan anchas que no las rodean diez personas.",
          "en": "It has a hall of 134 giant columns, so wide that ten people could not circle one."
        },
        {
          "es": "Amón no vivía solo. Con él estaban su esposa Mut y su hijo Jonsú, dios de la luna.",
          "en": "Amun did not live alone. With him were his wife Mut and their son Khonsu, the moon god."
        }
      ],
